{"id":226,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"体験探究ICT英語で学ぶ川口附属","feature_description":"川口市立高等学校附属中学校は、体験・探究、ICT活用、英語・国際理解を三つの柱として教育活動を進めると説明しています。少人数での探究的な学習やプレゼンテーションを重視し、6年間の主体的な学びで将来社会で活躍する力を育てる方針です。学びの三本柱が学校案内で明確で、グランドデザインや学校生活の流れも確認できます。生徒自治の視点も重視しています。","clubs":[{"id":4887,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4888,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4889,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4890,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4891,"name":"女子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4892,"name":"男子ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4893,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4894,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4895,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4896,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4897,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4898,"name":"ダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"http://www.kaw-s.ed.jp/jh-school/index.cfm/1,872,html","verified_at